# Intentionally empty.
#
# Vercel requires an output directory to exist after the build step, but this
# project serves no static assets — every path is rewritten to the serverless
# function in api/index.ts (see vercel.json). This directory exists solely to
# satisfy that check. Keep it empty: vercel.json's catch-all rewrite means
# anything placed here would be shadowed by the function anyway, and files here
# would be publicly downloadable.
